160748, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "knowledge-management", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780233239584, "description": "区位观察——从山川、交通、旧籍、人物、风俗五个维度理解一个地方。当用户问\"XX是什么地方\"\"给我讲讲XX\"\"XX在哪儿\"\"XX有什么特点\"，或说\"看看XX\"\"聊一下XX\"\"分析一下XX的区位\"时触发。不适用于纯行政区划查询、邮政编码/车牌归属、单纯的旅游攻略/美食推荐。", "description_zh": "一方地域的风骨，在群山分界、江河脉络、道路变迁之中。\n从上中下三层视角打量：看清它在区域格局里的定位，再以一县、一业、一街落地具象。山川既隔天地，亦通往来。参证《元和郡县志》《读史方舆纪要》《天下郡国利病书》与地方史志，厘清一地兴衰脉络。人物是地域鲜活的模样，或远行拓业，或留守扎根，风骨里总带着故土底色。风俗生于乡土，亦常顺着江河古道，在千里之外遥相呼应。\n观水土之风，察格局之雅，记风物之颂。\n行旅踏过城池，问风物几何，只为探寻这片土地的灵魂。", "downloads": 50, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e6fb806d/bardian-ballader-babelfisher42-may2026", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7f79eb60-b8d8-4d8e-9b79-6ace0de1ff17.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Bardian-Ballader/風雅頌", "ownerName": "user_e6fb806d", "score": 24509.803921568626, "slug": "bardian-ballader-babelfisher42-may2026", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "knowledge-base-qa", "name": "知识库问答"}, {"key": "knowledge-retrieval", "name": "信息检索"}, {"key": "knowledge-summary", "name": "摘要总结"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781817131431, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "it-ops-security", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780220261621, "description": "企微 AI Agent 可观测性工具 — 心跳监控、进程守护、敏感信息扫描、网络白名单，2 分钟接入", "description_zh": "企微 AI Agent 可观测性工具 — 心跳监控、进程守护、敏感信息扫描、网络白名单，2 分钟接入", "downloads": 50, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_4bfe8963/wecom-agent-ops-center", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_ke